// as the sort gives them, and FR mapping is recorded as pending in TOWERS_META.
// This is the SHELF (stocking material as data). A builder that assembles a
// tower from these parts is a separate future decision, not this module.
// The rooms count on each tower is a worksheet structural count from the
// book, not a stat; it is the only number allowed in tower entries.

